        Portable high quality random number generator state.
        Initialized with HQRNDRandomize() or HQRNDSeed().
        Fields:
            S1, S2      -   seed values
            V           -   precomputed value
            MagicV      -   'magic' value used to determine whether State structure
                            was correctly initialized.
